docs {
  # The hub API's tests

  Run against a scratch hub (`api-tests/run.sh` starts one: empty config, state in a temporary
  directory, no node daemon, no git host). Requests come from 127.0.0.1, so the hub treats them as
  the owner's and no token is needed.

  One folder per area. A folder's requests run in `seq` order, so a folder can create something,
  read it back, change it and delete it, passing ids along with `bru.setVar`.
}
